  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.aiolosikon.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.aiolosikon.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon"><head>ΑΙΟΛΟΣΙΚΩΝ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(1.) Athenæus III, p. 95 e.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ μὴν τὸ δεῖν᾽ ἀκροκώλιά γέ σοι τέτταρα</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἥψησα τακερά.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(2.) Suidas in ἀγοράσαι et Bekkeri Anecd. p. 331, 26.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ ἄνυσον· οὐ μέλλειν ἐχρῆν· ὡς ἀγοράσω</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἁπαξάπανθ᾽ ὅσ᾽ ἂν κελεύῃς, ὦ γύναι.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(3.) Pollux IX, 63.</note>
            <quote>Ἔστι δὲ καὶ τὸ διώβολον ἐν Αἰολοσίκωνι Ἀριστοφάνους</quote>
            <quote>Ὅπερ λοιπὸν μόνον ἦν ἐν τῇ γνάθῳ διώβολον γεγένητ᾽ ἐμοὶ δικόλλυβον.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(4.) Pollux X, 104.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Δοῖδυξ, Ουεία, τυροκνῆστις, ἐσχάρα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(5.) Pollux I, 79.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Κοιτὼν ἁπάσαις εἷς, πύελος δὲ μί᾽ ἀρκέσει.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(6.) Pollux X, 116, et Athenæus XV, p. 1561 ed. Dindorf.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ διαστίλβονθ᾽ ὁρῶμεν</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐν καινῷ λυχνούχῳ</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">πάντα τῆς ἐξωμίδος.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(7.) Pollux X, 118.</note>
            <quote>Ἐν τῷ Αἰολοσίκωνι Ἀριστοφάνης “ δυοῖν λυχνιδίον.”</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="8" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-8" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(8.) Hephæstio de metris cap. 9, p. 51 ed. Gaisf.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐκ ἐτὸς, ὦ γυναῖκες,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">πᾶσι κακοῖσιν ἡμᾶς</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">φλῶσιν ἑκάστοθ᾽ ἄνδρες·</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">δεινὰ γὰρ ἔργα δρῶσαι</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">λαμβανόμεσθ᾽ ὑπ᾽ αὐτῶν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Ad hanc fabulam fortasse referendi quos ex Aristophane versus attulit Athenæus I, p. 48 c. exscriptos ab Eustathio p. 1570, 5.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">Ὅστις ἐν ἡδυόσμοις</l>
              <l n="7" xml:lang="grc">στρώμασι παννυχίζων</l>
              <l n="8" xml:lang="grc">τὴν δέσποιναν ἐρείδεις.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="9" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-9" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(9.) Pollux X, 25.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ δι᾽ ὀπῆς κἀπὶ τέγους.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="10" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-10" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(10.) Athenæus VII, p. 276 c.</note>
            <quote>Τῶν δὲ παρόντων γραμματικῶν τις ἀποβλέψας εἰς τὴν τοῦ δείπνου παρασκευὴν ἔφη, Εἶτα πῶς δειπνήσομεν τοσαῦτα δεῖπνα; ἴσως διὰ νυκτός; ὡς ὁ χαρίεις Ἀριστοφάνης ἐν Αἰολοσίκωνι εἶπεν, οὕτως λέγων οἱονεὶ δι᾽ ὅλης νυκτός.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="11" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-11" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(11.) Pollux IX, 89.</note>
            <quote>Ἐν – τῷ Αἰολοσίκωνι τὸ μὴ ἔχειν κέρματα ἀκερματίαν ὠνόμασεν.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="12" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-12" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(12.) Pollux X, 24.</note>
            <quote>Παρὰ δὲ Ἀριστοφάνει ἐν Αἰολοσίκωνι καὶ κλειδίον.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="13" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-13" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(13.) Scholiasta Pacis v. 740.</note>
            <quote>Ἀριστοφάνης ὡς γαστρίμαργον τὸν Ἡρακλέα κωμῳδεῖ – ἐν Αἰολοσίκωνι.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="14" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-14" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(14.) Æolosiconis editionem alteram memorat Athenæus VIII, p. 372 a.</note>
            <quote>Ἀριστοφάνης Αἰολοσίκωνι δευτέρῳ</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τῶν δὲ γηθύων</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ῥίζας ἐχούσας σκοροδομίμητον φύσιν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="15" xml:id="fragment-aiolosikon-dindorf1893_grc1-15" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_aiolosikon">
            <note type="source">(15.) Ad hanc fabulam fortasse referendus Herodiani locus corruptus περὶ μονήρους λέξεως p. 7, 11.</note>
            <quote>ἀλλὰ καὶ ἡ νέα νῆ εἰρημένον – παρὰ Ἀριστοφάνει ἐν δινσίλλωνι καὶ ἐπιθυμήσειε νέος νῆς ἀμφιπόλοιο.</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Quæ ita videntur esse corrigenda, – ἐν Αἰολοσίκωνι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καί κ᾽ ἐπιθυμήσειε νέος νῆς ἀμφιπόλοιο.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
